msgctxt "candidate landing"
msgid "You stay in control"
msgstr "Vous gardez la main"

#: eures_beta/candidates/templates/candidates/landing.html:329
msgctxt "candidate landing"
msgid ""
"You can correct your information before confirming it. An introduction "
"requires your agreement and the employer’s."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourrez corriger vos informations avant de les valider. Une mise en "
"relation nécessite votre accord et celui de l’employeur."

