msgstr "Télécharger mon brouillon"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1232
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1301
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Validate my offer"
msgstr "Valider mon offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1237
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1305
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Download validated summary"
msgstr "Télécharger la fiche validée"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1241
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1302
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Back to my email"
msgstr "Retour à mon email"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1246
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Review the extracted information and clarify the job conditions."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez les informations reprises et précisez les conditions du poste."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1247
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Actual the preparation service response dated 15 October 2026 for the tested "
"Moovijob offer. Location is approximate and must be confirmed. the "
"preparation service did not generate the questions below."
msgstr ""
"Retour réel de la sandbox le service de préparation du 15 octobre 2026, pour "
"l’offre Moovijob testée. La localisation est approximative et doit être "
"confirmée. le service de préparation n’a pas produit les questions ci-"
"dessous."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1248
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Automatic reading of this source is not connected. Complete the form below; "
"no information has been invented from your file or link."
msgstr ""
"La lecture automatique de cette source n’est pas raccordée. Complétez la "
"fiche ci-dessous ; aucune information n’a été inventée à partir de votre "
"fichier ou de votre lien."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1288
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Question"
msgstr "Question"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1292
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "What experience do you have in brasserie cooking?"
msgstr "Quelle expérience avez-vous en cuisine de brasserie ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1293
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Which preparations can you handle: starters, hot dishes, meat cooking and "
"sauces?"
msgstr ""
"Quelles préparations maîtrisez-vous : entrées, plats chauds, cuissons des "
"viandes et sauces ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1294
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Can you work split shifts? Describe any constraints."
msgstr ""
"Pouvez-vous travailler en horaires coupés ? Précisez vos contraintes "
"éventuelles."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1295
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "When could you start?"
msgstr "À partir de quand seriez-vous disponible ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1296
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "How could you reach the workplace at the required times?"
msgstr ""
"Comment pourriez-vous rejoindre le lieu de travail aux horaires prévus ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1303
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Draft downloaded as JSON. Keep the file on your computer: nothing is saved "
"on the server."
msgstr ""
"Brouillon téléchargé en JSON. Conservez ce fichier sur votre ordinateur : "
"rien n’est enregistré sur le serveur."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1304
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your summary is ready to download. Downloading it does not update the preparation service or contact candidates."
msgstr "Votre récapitulatif est prêt à être téléchargé. Le téléchargement ne met pas à jour le service de préparation et ne contacte aucun candidat."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1306
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The offer has changed: review and confirm again before validating."
msgstr ""
"La fiche a été modifiée : vérifiez et confirmez à nouveau avant validation."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1307
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Complete job title, company, location, description and contract type, then "
"confirm. Every selected question must contain text."
msgstr ""
"Complétez le poste, l’entreprise, le lieu, la description et le type de "
"contrat, puis confirmez la fiche. Chaque question retenue doit contenir un "
"texte."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1309
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Save my draft"
msgstr "Enregistrer mon brouillon"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1310
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Draft saved in PostgreSQL on this computer. Resume it from this browser."
msgstr ""
"Brouillon enregistré dans PostgreSQL sur cet ordinateur. Vous pouvez le "
"reprendre depuis ce navigateur."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1311
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Confirm my offer"
msgstr "Valider mon offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1312
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your offer has been saved."
msgstr "Votre offre est enregistrée."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1313
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"AI-assisted offer summary. Review all information and clarify missing "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Fiche préparée avec une assistance par intelligence artificielle. Vérifiez "
"les informations et complétez les points à clarifier."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1314
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "An initial inactive offer has been sent to the preparation service. Validate your corrections to update it. Your email is not sent to the preparation service."
msgstr "Une première offre inactive a été transmise au service de préparation. Validez vos corrections pour la mettre à jour. Votre e-mail n’est pas transmis au service de préparation."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1316
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Vérifier sur OpenStreetMap"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1317
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "I checked the proposed point and confirm it matches the workplace."
msgstr ""
"J’ai vérifié le point proposé et confirme qu’il correspond au lieu de "
"travail."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1318
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "View the location on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Voir le lieu sur OpenStreetMap"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1319
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Unsure about the location? Check it on the map. This is optional."
msgstr ""
"Un doute sur le lieu ? Consultez la carte pour vérifier. C’est facultatif."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1320
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Saving and reading back from the preparation service…"
msgstr "Enregistrement de votre offre…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1321
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Saving draft…"
msgstr "Enregistrement du brouillon…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1323
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "What experience do you have for this job?"
msgstr "Quelle expérience avez-vous pour ce poste ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1324
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Which required skills do you have?"
msgstr "Quelles compétences du poste maîtrisez-vous ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1325
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "What are your availability and working-hour constraints?"
msgstr "Quelles sont vos disponibilités et contraintes horaires ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1326
msgctxt "employer import variant"
msgid "When could you start?"
msgstr "À partir de quand pourriez-vous commencer ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1327
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Can you reach the workplace at the required times?"
msgstr "Pouvez-vous rejoindre le lieu de travail aux horaires prévus ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1330
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Complete and save the company contact before validating the offer."
msgstr ""
"Renseignez et enregistrez le contact entreprise avant de valider l’offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1331
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The preparation service did not confirm complete storage. Corrections are saved; retry."
msgstr "Le service de préparation n’a pas confirmé l’enregistrement complet. Les corrections sont conservées ; réessayez."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1332
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The preparation service is not configured. You can enter the information manually."
msgstr "Le service de préparation n’est pas configuré. Vous pouvez saisir les informations manuellement."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1333
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Location not found. Specify city, country and street if possible."
msgstr "Lieu non trouvé. Précisez la ville, le pays et si possible l’adresse."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1334
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check the map point and confirm the workplace."
msgstr "Vérifiez le point sur la carte puis confirmez le lieu."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1335
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Complete essential fields and confirm."
msgstr "Complétez les champs essentiels et confirmez la fiche."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1336
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Draft changed in another tab. Reload it first."
msgstr ""
"Le brouillon a changé dans un autre onglet. Rechargez-le avant de continuer."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1337
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check fields, questions and lengths."
msgstr "Vérifiez les champs, les questions et leurs longueurs."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1338
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The service is unavailable. Your entries remain on screen."
msgstr "Le service est indisponible. Vos saisies restent affichées."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1339
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"the preparation service requires a job title, company, location and "
"description. Complete missing fields to send an initial inactive version. "
"You will then review its response and questions."
msgstr ""
"le service de préparation exige le poste, l’entreprise, le lieu et une "
"description. Complétez les informations manquantes pour envoyer une première "
"version inactive. Vous vérifierez ensuite le retour et les questions."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1340
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1587
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "External saving is unavailable. You can save the draft in Match Europe."
msgstr "L’enregistrement externe est indisponible. Vous pouvez enregistrer le brouillon dans Match Europe."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1343
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Some information before sending to the preparation service"
msgstr "Complétez les informations nécessaires"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1344
msgctxt "employer import variant"
msgid ""
"the preparation service requires a job title, company, location and "
"description. Complete missing fields to send an initial inactive version. "
"You will then review its response and questions."
msgstr ""
"Le poste, l’entreprise, le lieu et une description sont nécessaires pour "
"préparer votre fiche avec une assistance par IA. Vous pourrez ensuite "
"vérifier et corriger le résultat."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1345
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Send to the preparation service and retrieve the offer"
msgstr "Préparer ma fiche"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1348
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Modifier"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1396
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The role involves: {items}. Can you work under these conditions?"
msgstr ""
"Le poste prévoit les conditions suivantes : {items}. Pouvez-vous travailler "
"dans ces conditions ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1397
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Do you hold these licences or authorisations: {items}?"
msgstr "Disposez-vous des permis ou autorisations suivants : {items} ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1398
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "When could you start and, if needed, relocate near the workplace?"
msgstr ""
"À partir de quand pourriez-vous commencer et, si nécessaire, vous installer "
"près du lieu de travail ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1414
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1472
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your offer has been saved"
msgstr "Votre offre est enregistrée"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1415
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1473
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"You have completed this step. You can review the saved information below."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez terminé cette étape. Vous pouvez consulter les informations "
"enregistrées ci-dessous."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1416
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1474
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "What happens next?"
msgstr "Et ensuite ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1418
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1476
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Your offer is saved with the job conditions and arrival support you "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Votre offre est conservée avec les conditions du poste et les aides à "
"l’arrivée que vous avez indiquées."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1419
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1477
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"The next step in the journey will be candidate prequalification: "
"availability, skills and job requirements."
msgstr ""
"La prochaine étape du parcours sera la préqualification des candidatures : "
"disponibilité, compétences et exigences du poste."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1420
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1478
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"An introduction will then require agreement from you and the candidate, with "
"support from an adviser."
msgstr ""
"La mise en relation nécessitera ensuite votre accord et celui du candidat, "
"avec l’accompagnement d’un conseiller."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1422
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1480
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Saving the offer does not start a candidate search, prequalification or contact."
msgstr "L’enregistrement de l’offre ne lance pas de recherche de candidats, de préqualification ou de prise de contact."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1423
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1482
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "View my offer"
msgstr "Voir mon offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1424
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1492
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Add another offer"
msgstr "Ajouter une autre offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1425
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1489
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Back to the employer home"
msgstr "Revenir à l’accueil employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1427
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Offer extracted from your document. Check and complete the information."
msgstr ""
"Fiche extraite de votre document. Vérifiez et complétez les informations."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1428
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Text extraction without generative AI. Check and correct the result before saving."
msgstr "Extraction du texte sans IA générative. Vérifiez et corrigez le résultat avant l’enregistrement."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1430
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The draft is saved in Match Europe. Saving does not publish the offer or start a candidate search."
msgstr "Le brouillon est enregistré dans Match Europe. L’enregistrement ne publie pas l’offre et ne lance pas de recherche de candidats."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1431
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your offer has been saved in Match Europe."
msgstr "Votre offre a été enregistrée dans Match Europe."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1433
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Document information to check"
msgstr "Informations à vérifier dans le document"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1434
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Conflicting hours — please confirm"
msgstr "Horaires contradictoires — à confirmer"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1435
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Multiple contract types — please confirm"
msgstr "Plusieurs types de contrat — à confirmer"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1436
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Clarify location or remote work conditions"
msgstr "Lieu ou conditions de télétravail à préciser"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1437
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Text recognized from an image: check for recognition errors"
msgstr "Texte reconnu dans une image : vérifiez les erreurs éventuelles"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1438
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Please confirm this information"
msgstr "Information à confirmer"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1496
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1532
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Next step: review your offer"
msgstr "La prochaine étape : vérifier votre offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1500
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1534
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Start again"
msgstr "Recommencer"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1506
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Match Europe · A France Travail / EURES / ADEM / Le Forem / ELA experiment"
msgstr ""
"Match Europe · Une expérimentation France Travail / EURES / ADEM / Le "
"Forem / ELA"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1507
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Useful links"
msgstr "Liens utiles"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1516
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Add your job offer"
msgstr "Ajoutez votre offre d’emploi"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1517
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Import a PDF, paste a link to a public job offer or enter your offer "
"manually. We will prepare a summary for you to check and complete."
msgstr ""
"Importez un PDF, collez le lien d’une offre publique ou renseignez votre "
"offre manuellement. Nous préparerons une fiche que vous pourrez vérifier et "
"compléter."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1523
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "I prefer to enter my offer manually"
msgstr "Je préfère renseigner mon offre manuellement"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1535
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check your information before saving. You can also download a summary to your computer."
msgstr "Vérifiez vos informations avant l’enregistrement. Vous pouvez aussi télécharger un récapitulatif sur votre ordinateur."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1536
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1577
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Choose one PDF or PNG/JPEG images of the same job."
msgstr "Choisissez un PDF seul ou des images PNG/JPEG d’une même offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1537
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1578
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Limit: 8 images and 10 MB total, or one 10 MB PDF."
msgstr "Limite : 8 images et 10 Mo au total, ou un PDF de 10 Mo."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1538
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Choose a PDF or images to continue."
msgstr "Choisissez un PDF ou des images pour continuer."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1539
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1576
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The document could not be read. Try another file or paste the text."
msgstr "Le document n’a pas pu être lu. Essayez un autre fichier ou collez le texte."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1540
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Enter your offer text to continue."
msgstr "Renseignez le texte de votre offre pour continuer."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1542
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your offer"
msgstr "Votre offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1543
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Vérification"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1544
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrement"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1546
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Selected file: "
msgstr "Fichier sélectionné : "

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1548
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your agreement to prepare the offer"
msgstr "Votre accord pour préparer l’offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1549
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"I request AI-assisted preparation of my offer. Offer information is sent to "
"a technical service provider to prepare a summary for my review. My email is "
"not sent to that provider."
msgstr ""
"Je demande la préparation de mon offre avec une assistance par intelligence "
"artificielle. Les informations de l’offre sont transmises à un prestataire "
"technique pour préparer la fiche que je vérifierai. Mon email ne lui est pas "
"transmis."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1550
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Artificial intelligence helps structure your offer and identify information "
"to clarify. It can make mistakes: you will review and correct the summary "
"before confirming it."
msgstr ""
"Une intelligence artificielle aide à structurer votre offre et à repérer les "
"informations à préciser. Elle peut produire des erreurs : vous vérifierez et "
"corrigerez la fiche avant de la valider."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1551
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Read the privacy notice before continuing."
msgstr "Consultez la notice de confidentialité avant de continuer."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1552
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Use a job offer link"
msgstr "Utiliser le lien d’une offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1556
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"Enter an HTTPS link to a public website, without credentials or a local "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Indiquez un lien HTTPS vers un site public, sans identifiants ni adresse "
"locale."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1566
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check the extracted information before saving. Reading a document does not publish an offer or start a candidate search."
msgstr "Vérifiez les informations extraites avant l’enregistrement. La lecture d’un document ne publie pas d’offre et ne lance pas de recherche de candidats."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1567
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your email is saved with your draft."
msgstr "Votre adresse e-mail est enregistrée avec votre brouillon."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1568
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "No application is assessed or rejected at this step."
msgstr "Aucune candidature n’est évaluée ou écartée à cette étape."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1569
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The page will be checked before we ask for your email."
msgstr "La page sera vérifiée avant de vous demander votre email."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1570
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Reading and preparing your offer…"
msgstr "Lecture et préparation de votre offre…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1571
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Resume a draft in this browser"
msgstr "Reprendre un brouillon sur ce navigateur"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1572
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Unable to continue: "
msgstr "Impossible de continuer : "

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1574
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Use a public HTTPS page without credentials or internal addresses."
msgstr ""
"Le lien doit viser une page HTTPS publique, sans identifiants ni adresse "
"interne."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1575
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"The site is unavailable or does not allow this page to be read automatically."
msgstr ""
"Le site est inaccessible ou ne permet pas la lecture automatique de cette "
"page."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1579
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Confirm agreement to prepare the offer."
msgstr "Confirmez votre accord pour préparer l’offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1580
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check your email."
msgstr "Vérifiez votre email."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1581
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check the fields and text length."
msgstr "Vérifiez les champs et la longueur du texte."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1582
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "This session has reached 30 drafts."
msgstr "La limite de 30 brouillons de cette session est atteinte."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1583
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "This draft is unavailable in this session."
msgstr "Ce brouillon n’est pas accessible depuis cette session."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1585
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"This link opens a list of offers. Open the individual advert on France "
"Travail and copy its specific link."
msgstr ""
"Ce lien mène à une liste d’offres. Ouvrez l’annonce souhaitée sur France "
"Travail, puis copiez le lien de cette annonce précise."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1586
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Check the company contact name and email."
msgstr "Vérifiez le nom et l’email du contact entreprise."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1590
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Read this offer"
msgstr "Lire cette offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1592
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Reading the link…"
msgstr "Lecture du lien en cours…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1593
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "We cannot read this offer"
msgstr "Nous ne pouvons pas lire cette offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1594
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Choose another method: import a PDF or paste the offer text."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez une autre méthode : importer un PDF ou copier-coller le texte de "
"l’annonce."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1595
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Read documents"
msgstr "Lire les documents"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1596
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Reading documents…"
msgstr "Lecture des documents en cours…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1597
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "By clicking “Read documents”, you request text extraction without generative AI. Check and correct the result before saving. This action does not publish the offer or start a candidate search."
msgstr "En cliquant sur « Lire les documents », vous demandez une extraction du texte sans IA générative. Vérifiez et corrigez le résultat avant l’enregistrement. Cette action ne publie pas l’offre et ne lance pas de recherche de candidats."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1598
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Choose a PDF or images"
msgstr "Choisir un PDF ou des images"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1599
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "One PDF or up to 8 PNG/JPEG images of the same job, in reading order · 10 MB total."
msgstr "Un PDF ou jusqu’à 8 images PNG/JPEG de la même offre, dans l’ordre de lecture · 10 Mo au total."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1600
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Import a PDF or images"
msgstr "Importer un PDF ou des images"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1601
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your job is in a document or screenshots."
msgstr "Votre offre est dans un document ou des captures d’écran."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1608
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Your contact for the adviser"
msgstr "Votre contact pour le conseiller"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1609
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Nom et prénom"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1610
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Contact email"
msgstr "Email du contact"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1611
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Phone (optional)"
msgstr "Téléphone (facultatif)"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1612
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Role in the company (optional)"
msgstr "Fonction dans l’entreprise (facultatif)"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1613
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid ""
"These contact details can be viewed by the adviser responsible for your "
"offer and administrators. They are not shown to candidates."
msgstr ""
"Ces coordonnées sont consultables par le conseiller chargé de votre offre et "
"les administrateurs. Elles ne sont pas affichées aux candidats."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1614
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Save contact"
msgstr "Enregistrer le contact"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1615
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Contact saved."
msgstr "Contact enregistré."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1616
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "Unable to save the contact. Check the fields."
msgstr "Impossible d’enregistrer le contact. Vérifiez les champs."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1617
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The draft has changed. Reload it before editing the contact."
msgstr "Le brouillon a changé. Rechargez-le avant de modifier le contact."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/import.html:1618
msgctxt "employer import"
msgid "The contact may be different from the person accessing this workspace."
msgstr "Le contact peut être différent de la personne qui accède à cet espace."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:8
