msgid "Project"
msgstr "Le projet"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:222
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:333
#: eures_beta/templates/public_base.html:226
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Project journal"
msgstr "Journal du projet"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:226
#: eures_beta/templates/public_base.html:230
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:242
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Me connecter"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:252
#: eures_beta/templates/public_base.html:251
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Partners"
msgstr "Partenaires"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:279
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Employer journey"
msgstr "Parcours employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:280
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Make recruitment easier through European mobility"
msgstr "Recrutez plus facilement grâce à la mobilité européenne"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:281
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Already written your job offer? Import a PDF or add the link to your advert "
"to prepare and save your recruitment needs."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez déjà rédigé votre offre ? Importez un PDF ou ajoutez le lien de "
"votre annonce pour préparer et enregistrer vos besoins de recrutement."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:284
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Import my job offer"
msgstr "Importer mon offre d’emploi"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:288
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Your offer is read, then checked with you"
msgstr "Votre offre est lue, puis vérifiée avec vous"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:290
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Match Europe reads and analyses your document to turn its information into a "
"structured summary: role, skills, languages and working conditions."
msgstr ""
"Match Europe lit et analyse votre document pour en reprendre les "
"informations dans une fiche structurée : poste, compétences, langues et "
"conditions proposées."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:293
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Check this summary, correct any information if needed and complete what is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Vous vérifiez cette fiche, corrigez les informations si nécessaire et "
"complétez ce qui manque."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:294
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"If information is missing or unclear, you will be asked additional "
"questions. In particular, specify whether you can welcome cross-border "
"workers or people relocating from another European country."
msgstr ""
"Si certaines informations sont manquantes ou ambiguës, des questions "
"complémentaires vous sont posées. Vous précisez notamment si vous pouvez "
"accueillir des travailleurs frontaliers ou des personnes venant s’installer "
"depuis un autre pays européen."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:295
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Choose questions to prequalify applications against job requirements, such "
"as availability, experience, languages or working hours. Interested "
"candidates answer before an introduction. Their answers help you identify "
"applications to pursue and reject those that do not meet job requirements. "
"No candidate is rejected automatically solely on the basis of their answers."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez les questions qui permettront de préqualifier les candidatures "
"selon les exigences du poste : disponibilité, expérience, langues ou "
"horaires, par exemple. Les candidats intéressés y répondront avant la mise "
"en relation. Leurs réponses vous aideront à identifier les candidatures à "
"poursuivre et à écarter celles qui ne répondent pas aux exigences du poste. "
"Aucun candidat n’est écarté automatiquement sur la seule base de ses "
"réponses."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:296
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Saving your offer does not start a candidate search. Matching is coming soon."
msgstr ""
"L’enregistrement de votre offre ne lance pas de recherche de candidats. Le "
"rapprochement sera disponible prochainement."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:299
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "How the service can help"
msgstr "Ce que le service peut vous apporter"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:300
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Broaden your search beyond your local market, prepare candidate "
"prequalification and talk to interested candidates, with support from your "
"EURES adviser."
msgstr ""
"Élargir votre recherche au-delà de votre marché local, préparer la "
"qualification des candidatures et échanger avec les candidats intéressés, "
"avec l’appui de votre conseiller EURES."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:305
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "What happens next"
msgstr "Ce qui se passe ensuite"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:307
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "1. Add your offer as a PDF, a link or manual text."
msgstr "1. Ajoutez votre offre au format PDF, par lien ou par saisie manuelle."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:308
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "2. Check the information and answer any additional questions."
msgstr ""
"2. Vérifiez les informations reprises et répondez aux éventuelles questions "
"complémentaires."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:309
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "3. Prepare your questions for candidates and save your offer."
msgstr ""
"3. Préparez vos questions pour les candidats et enregistrez votre offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:310
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"4. Coming soon: matching with candidates. No matching is carried out at this "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"4. Prochainement : le rapprochement avec des candidats. Aucun rapprochement "
"n’est effectué à ce stade."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:314
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "You stay in control"
msgstr "Vous gardez la main"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:315
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"A match between an offer and a profile remains a suggestion. An introduction "
"requires both your agreement and the candidate’s. Your adviser then starts a "
"three-way conversation."
msgstr ""
"Une correspondance entre une offre et un profil reste une proposition. La "
"mise en relation nécessite votre accord et celui du candidat. Votre "
"conseiller initie ensuite une conversation à trois."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:318
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Accessible support"
msgstr "Un accompagnement accessible"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:320
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "On desktop and mobile."
msgstr "Sur ordinateur comme sur mobile."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:321
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Targeted questions with quick replies and free text."
msgstr "Des questions ciblées, avec réponses rapides et texte libre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:322
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "An EURES adviser to support the conversation."
msgstr "Un conseiller EURES pour accompagner les échanges."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:330
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid ""
"Match Europe · A France Travail / EURES / ADEM / Le Forem / ELA experiment"
msgstr ""
"Match Europe · Une expérimentation France Travail / EURES / ADEM / Le "
"Forem / ELA"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:331
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Useful links"
msgstr "Liens utiles"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html:334
#: eures_beta/templates/public_base.html:282
msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Data protection"
msgstr "Protection des données"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:3
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Which languages are needed for this role?"
msgstr "Quelles langues sont nécessaires pour ce poste ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:4
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid ""
"Select the minimum level needed for each language. The descriptions are "
"practical guidance, not a language assessment."
msgstr ""
"Indiquez le niveau minimum nécessaire pour chaque langue. Les descriptions "
"sont des repères pratiques, pas une évaluation linguistique."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:5
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Select a level"
msgstr "Choisir un niveau"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:6
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Not required"
msgstr "Pas nécessaire"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:7
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "A1 — Understand and use very simple words and phrases"
msgstr "A1 — Comprendre et utiliser des mots et phrases très simples"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:8
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "A2 — Communicate about simple, routine tasks"
msgstr "A2 — Échanger sur des tâches simples et habituelles"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:9
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "B1 — Handle familiar situations and explain simple points"
msgstr ""
"B1 — Se débrouiller dans les situations habituelles et expliquer simplement"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:10
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "B2 — Communicate with ease and discuss detailed matters"
msgstr "B2 — Échanger avec aisance et discuter de sujets détaillés"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:11
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "C1 — Communicate fluently and precisely in complex situations"
msgstr ""
"C1 — Communiquer avec fluidité et précision dans des situations complexes"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:12
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "C2 — Understand almost everything and express fine distinctions"
msgstr "C2 — Comprendre presque tout et exprimer des nuances fines"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:13
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "French"
msgstr "Français"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:14
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "German"
msgstr "Allemand"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:15
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "English"
msgstr "Anglais"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:16
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Luxembourgish"
msgstr "Luxembourgeois"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:17
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Information already provided"
msgstr "Information déjà fournie"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:18
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Prefilled level — check this selection."
msgstr "Niveau prérempli — vérifiez cette sélection."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:19
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid ""
"Some wording could not be converted into an exact level. Please confirm the "
"choices; the source text is retained."
msgstr ""
"Certaines formulations ne permettent pas de déterminer un niveau exact. "
"Confirmez les choix ; le texte source est conservé."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:20
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Another language (optional)"
msgstr "Autre langue — facultatif"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:21
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Level for the additional language"
msgstr "Niveau de l’autre langue"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:22
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Add a language"
msgstr "Ajouter une langue"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:23
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Search for a language"
msgstr "Rechercher une langue"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:24
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Retirer"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:25
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "No particular language requirement"
msgstr "Aucune exigence linguistique particulière"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:26
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "Select a suggested language, or confirm that no language is required."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez une langue proposée ou indiquez qu’aucune langue n’est exigée."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/language_strings.html:27
msgctxt "employer languages"
msgid "No language found. Try another name."
msgstr "Aucune langue trouvée. Essayez un autre nom."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:4
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"Two independent searches. Select the results that describe your job; no "
"equivalence between ESCO and ROME is assumed."
msgstr ""
"Deux recherches indépendantes. Sélectionnez les résultats qui décrivent "
"votre poste ; aucune équivalence entre ESCO et ROME n’est supposée."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:5
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "ESCO · Occupation descriptions"
msgstr "ESCO · Descriptions des métiers"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:6
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "ROME · Job titles"
msgstr "ROME · Intitulés des métiers"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:7
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "French ROME catalogue, searched directly by job title or code. Detailed descriptions are not included."
msgstr "Référentiel ROME français, recherché directement par intitulé ou code métier. Les descriptions détaillées ne sont pas incluses."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:8
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "No ROME result. Try a French job title or a ROME code."
msgstr "Aucun résultat ROME. Essayez un intitulé en français ou un code ROME."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:9
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "No ESCO description found for this search."
msgstr "Aucune description ESCO trouvée pour cette recherche."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:10
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "ESCO reference"
msgstr "Référence ESCO"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:11
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "{count} result(s) found. Select those that fit."
msgstr "{count} résultat(s) trouvé(s). Sélectionnez ceux qui conviennent."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:12
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Retry automatic search"
msgstr "Réessayer la recherche automatique"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:13
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"The search could not be completed. Retry the automatic search or enter an "
"occupation in the search field. This does not mean that no match exists."
msgstr ""
"La recherche n’a pas abouti. Réessayez la recherche automatique ou saisissez "
"un métier dans le champ de recherche. Cela ne signifie pas qu’aucune "
"correspondance n’existe."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:14
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Describe the job offered"
msgstr "Précisez le métier proposé"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:15
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"Choose at least one description. Your own job title is kept; these choices "
"describe the occupation without replacing your offer’s duties."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez au moins une description. Votre intitulé reste celui que vous "
"avez saisi ; ces choix précisent le métier sans remplacer les missions de "
"votre offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:16
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Find descriptions"
msgstr "Trouver des descriptions"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:17
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "None of these descriptions fits"
msgstr "Aucune de ces descriptions ne convient"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:18
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Describe the job in your own words"
msgstr "Décrivez le métier avec vos mots"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:19
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"If no suggestion fits, write a description. No ESCO or ROME code will be "
"invented."
msgstr ""
"Si aucune proposition ne convient, écrivez une description. Aucun code ESCO "
"ou ROME ne sera inventé."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:20
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"These jobs belong to the same occupational family. Check the descriptions "
"before choosing."
msgstr ""
"Voici des métiers de la même famille professionnelle. Vérifiez les "
"descriptions avant de choisir."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:21
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"No description found. Try another title or describe the job in your own "
"words."
msgstr ""
"Aucune description trouvée. Essayez un autre intitulé ou décrivez le métier "
"avec vos mots."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:22
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Finding descriptions…"
msgstr "Recherche des descriptions…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:23
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"Unable to load descriptions. Try again; your other information is preserved."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de charger les descriptions. Réessayez ; vos autres informations "
"sont conservées."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:24
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Choose at least one job description, or write your own if none fits."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez au moins une description du métier, ou écrivez votre description "
"si aucune ne convient."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:25
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "ESCO and ROME references"
msgstr "Références ESCO et ROME"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:26
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "No ROME correspondence available."
msgstr "Aucune correspondance ROME disponible."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:27
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"ESCO 1.2.1 · ROME links 25M06 · fiche codes 26M10. Editions differ; these "
"links are not automatic equivalents."
msgstr ""
"ESCO 1.2.1 · liens ROME 25M06 · codes de fiches 26M10. Les éditions "
"diffèrent ; ces liens ne sont pas des équivalences automatiques."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:28
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Selected job descriptions"
msgstr "Descriptions du métier retenues"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:29
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"Title changed: search for descriptions and confirm your choices for this job."
msgstr ""
"Intitulé modifié : recherchez les descriptions et confirmez vos choix pour "
"ce métier."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:30
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Job title detected in your job description"
msgstr "Intitulé repéré dans votre fiche de poste"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:31
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Title of your offer"
msgstr "Intitulé de votre offre"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:32
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Which occupation matches this job?"
msgstr "À quel métier correspond ce poste ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:33
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"Type a job name. Suggestions appear as you type. Searching does not change "
"your offer title."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez un nom de métier. Les propositions apparaissent pendant la saisie. "
"Cette recherche ne modifie pas l’intitulé de votre offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:34
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Do you know an ESCO reference or a ROME code?"
msgstr "Vous connaissez une référence ESCO ou un code ROME ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:35
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "ESCO reference or ROME code"
msgstr "Référence ESCO ou code ROME"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:36
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"For example: ROME D1102, an ESCO occupation code, UUID or full URI. One ROME "
"code may match several ESCO occupations; check their descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Exemple : ROME D1102, un code métier ESCO, son identifiant UUID ou son URI "
"complète. Un code ROME peut correspondre à plusieurs métiers ESCO : vérifiez "
"leurs descriptions."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:37
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Type at least two characters to see suggestions."
msgstr "Saisissez au moins deux caractères pour voir les propositions."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:38
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "{count} description(s) found. Choose those that fit."
msgstr "{count} description(s) trouvée(s). Choisissez celles qui conviennent."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:39
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"The first 20 matches are shown. Refine your search by job name if needed."
msgstr ""
"Les 20 premiers résultats sont affichés. Précisez si nécessaire avec un nom "
"de métier."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:40
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Occupation suggestions"
msgstr "Propositions de métiers"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:41
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"We found no matching occupation. Please enter a job title manually to help "
"us find the best match, or enter an ESCO or ROME code if you know it."
msgstr ""
"Nous n’avons pas trouvé de correspondance. Veuillez saisir un intitulé de "
"métier manuellement pour nous aider à trouver la meilleure correspondance, "
"ou saisir directement un code métier ESCO ou ROME si vous le connaissez."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:42
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"Enter another job title to help us find the best match, or enter an ESCO or "
"ROME code if you know it."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez un autre intitulé de métier pour nous aider à trouver la meilleure "
"correspondance, ou un code métier ESCO ou ROME si vous le connaissez."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:43
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Job title to search for"
msgstr "Intitulé du métier à rechercher"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:44
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Job title, ROME code or ESCO reference"
msgstr "Intitulé du métier, code ROME ou référence ESCO"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:45
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"For example: baker, D1102, an ESCO occupation code, UUID or full URI. The "
"input format is detected automatically; your offer title stays unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Exemples : boulanger, D1102, un code métier ESCO, son UUID ou son URI "
"complète. Le format est reconnu automatiquement ; l’intitulé de votre offre "
"reste inchangé."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:46
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid ""
"The job title detected in your job description did not allow us to find a "
"match automatically. Enter a job title, ROME code or ESCO reference below."
msgstr ""
"L’intitulé déduit de votre fiche de poste ne nous a pas permis de trouver "
"une correspondance automatiquement. Saisissez ci-dessous un intitulé, un "
"code ROME ou une référence ESCO."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:47
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Search for an occupation"
msgstr "Rechercher un métier"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:48
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "Job title or ROME/ESCO code."
msgstr "Intitulé ou code ROME/ESCO."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/occupation_strings.html:49
msgctxt "employer occupations"
msgid "For example: baker or D1102"
msgstr "Ex. : boulanger ou D1102"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:8
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:181
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Data protection"
msgstr "Protection des données"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:14
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Notice dated 3 August 2026 — needs updating and validation for the offer import journey."
msgstr "Notice du 3 août 2026 — à mettre à jour et à valider pour le parcours d’import d’offre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:21
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Accueil"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:23
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Candidate"
msgstr "Candidat"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:25
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Employer"
msgstr "Employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:27
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Stats"
msgstr "Statistiques"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:31
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:179
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Project"
msgstr "Le projet"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:33
#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:180
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Project journal"
msgstr "Journal du projet"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:36
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:50
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Information about your personal data"
msgstr "Information sur vos données personnelles"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:51
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "How Match Europe uses your information"
msgstr "Comment Match Europe utilise vos informations"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:52
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Match Europe is an EURES network experiment conducted with France Travail. "
"This notice describes the processing currently planned for questionnaires, "
"matching and the limited WhatsApp Business test."
msgstr ""
"Match Europe est une expérimentation du réseau EURES portée avec France "
"Travail. Cette notice décrit les traitements actuellement prévus pour les "
"questionnaires, le matching et le test limité de WhatsApp Business."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:54
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Version dated 3 August 2026. France Travail is responsible for the "
"processing carried out as part of the Match Europe experiment. Eric "
"Barthélémy is the sole contact point during this phase."
msgstr ""
"Version du 3 août 2026. Le traitement est placé sous la responsabilité de "
"France Travail dans le cadre de l’expérimentation Match Europe. Eric "
"Barthélémy est le point de contact unique pendant cette phase."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:60
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Company contact"
msgstr "Contact de l’entreprise"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:61
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "The contact name and email, plus the optional phone and role, are stored with the draft so the adviser can contact you. The employer can view and edit them in this browser. The assigned adviser and administrators can view them in their workspaces. These fields are not shown to candidates or included in the offer export. Retention and the privacy notice remain to be defined; this historical copy does not validate the new journey."
msgstr "Le nom et l’e-mail du contact, ainsi que son téléphone et sa fonction facultatifs, sont enregistrés avec le brouillon pour permettre au conseiller de vous contacter. L’employeur peut les consulter et les modifier dans ce navigateur. Le conseiller affecté et les administrateurs peuvent les consulter dans leurs espaces. Ces champs ne sont pas affichés aux candidats ni inclus dans l’export de l’offre. La conservation et la notice de confidentialité restent à définir ; cette copie historique ne valide pas le nouveau parcours."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:68
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Why do we use your data?"
msgstr "Pourquoi utilisons-nous vos données ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:70
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Understand a professional mobility project or recruitment need."
msgstr "Comprendre le projet professionnel ou le besoin de recrutement."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:71
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Identify possible matches between candidates and employers."
msgstr ""
"Identifier des correspondances possibles entre candidats et employeurs."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:72
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Offer and monitor a human-supervised introduction."
msgstr "Proposer et suivre une mise en relation avec intervention humaine."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:73
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Assess the experiment using aggregated indicators."
msgstr "Évaluer l’utilité de l’expérimentation à partir d’indicateurs agrégés."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:80
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "What information is involved?"
msgstr "Quelles informations sont concernées ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:82
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Answers to the candidate or employer questionnaire."
msgstr "Les réponses aux questionnaires candidat ou employeur."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:83
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Contact details needed to contact you again."
msgstr "Les coordonnées nécessaires pour vous recontacter."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:84
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Professional information relevant to matching."
msgstr "Les informations professionnelles utiles au matching."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:85
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Evidence of your choices, contact dates and the outcome of an introduction."
msgstr ""
"La preuve de vos choix, les dates de contact et l’issue de la mise en "
"relation."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:92
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Who can access it?"
msgstr "Qui peut y accéder ?"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:94
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Authorised members of the Match Europe team and, where needed for an "
"introduction, the relevant EURES partners."
msgstr ""
"Les personnes habilitées de l’équipe Match Europe et, lorsque cela est "
"nécessaire à une mise en relation, les partenaires EURES concernés."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:95
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"An employer or candidate receives only the information needed for the "
"proposed introduction."
msgstr ""
"Un employeur ou un candidat ne reçoit que les informations nécessaires à la "
"mise en relation proposée."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:96
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Personal data is not published; public statistics are aggregated."
msgstr ""
"Les données ne sont pas publiées et les statistiques publiques sont agrégées."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:103
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "AI-assisted offer preparation"
msgstr "Préparation de l’offre avec une intelligence artificielle"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:105
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Artificial intelligence helps structure your offer into a summary for "
"review. Results may contain errors or omissions; you can correct them before "
"confirming."
msgstr ""
"Une intelligence artificielle aide à structurer les informations de votre "
"offre et à préparer une fiche à vérifier. Les résultats peuvent contenir des "
"erreurs ou des omissions ; vous pouvez les corriger avant validation."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:106
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Offer information is sent to a technical AI preparation provider. This "
"journey does not send your contact email to that provider. Avoid including "
"personal contact details or sensitive data in the offer."
msgstr ""
"Les informations de l’offre sont transmises à un prestataire technique de "
"préparation assistée par IA. Votre email de suivi ne lui est pas transmis "
"par ce parcours. Évitez d’inclure des coordonnées personnelles ou des "
"données sensibles dans l’annonce."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:107
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"This step does not decide whether to accept or reject an application. "
"Recruitment and introduction decisions remain human."
msgstr ""
"Cette étape ne décide pas de l’acceptation ou du rejet d’une candidature. "
"Les décisions de recrutement et de mise en relation restent humaines."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:114
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Candidate prequalification"
msgstr "Préqualification des candidatures"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:116
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"The employer defines questions related to job requirements, such as "
"availability, skills, languages or working hours. Interested candidates "
"answer before a possible introduction, using suggested answers and/or free "
"text."
msgstr ""
"L’employeur définit des questions liées aux exigences du poste, par exemple "
"la disponibilité, les compétences, les langues ou les horaires. Les "
"candidats intéressés y répondent avant une éventuelle mise en relation, au "
"moyen de réponses proposées et/ou de texte libre."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:117
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Answers help check essential job requirements and help the employer and "
"adviser decide which applications to pursue or reject. No candidate is "
"rejected automatically solely on the basis of their answers."
msgstr ""
"Ces réponses servent à vérifier les critères essentiels du poste et à aider "
"l’employeur et le conseiller à déterminer les candidatures à poursuivre ou à "
"écarter. Aucun candidat n’est écarté automatiquement sur la seule base de "
"ses réponses."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:118
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Draft answers remain private to the candidate. Once submitted, answers are "
"available to the employer concerned and the authorised adviser supporting "
"the application."
msgstr ""
"Les réponses en cours de rédaction restent privées au candidat. Une fois "
"envoyées, elles sont accessibles à l’employeur concerné et au conseiller "
"habilité qui accompagne la candidature."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:119
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Questions must relate to professional job requirements. Do not include "
"health data, identity documents or other sensitive information in free-text "
"answers."
msgstr ""
"Les questions doivent porter sur les exigences professionnelles du poste. Ne "
"communiquez pas de données de santé, de document d’identité ou d’autres "
"informations sensibles dans les réponses libres."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:120
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Submitting answers does not constitute agreement to open a conversation. An "
"introduction requires separate agreement from both the candidate and "
"employer, followed by the adviser’s intervention."
msgstr ""
"L’envoi des réponses ne vaut pas accord pour ouvrir une conversation. La "
"mise en relation nécessite l’accord distinct du candidat et de l’employeur, "
"puis l’intervention du conseiller."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:127
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Voluntary participation"
msgstr "Participation volontaire"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:129
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "You may refuse to participate or ask for contact to stop."
msgstr "Vous pouvez refuser de participer ou demander l’arrêt des échanges."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:130
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Refusing WhatsApp does not prevent the use of another channel such as email "
"or telephone."
msgstr ""
"Le refus de WhatsApp n’empêche pas l’utilisation d’un autre canal, notamment "
"le courriel ou le téléphone."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:131
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Match Europe does not make automated recruitment decisions."
msgstr ""
"Aucune décision de recrutement n’est prise automatiquement par Match Europe."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:138
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Limited WhatsApp Business test"
msgstr "Test limité de WhatsApp Business"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:140
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"WhatsApp is offered only after a match has been identified and after "
"separate agreement from the candidate and employer."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp n’est proposé qu’après l’identification d’un matching et après "
"l’accord distinct du candidat et de l’employeur."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:141
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"In a group, other participants can see your number, name or username, "
"profile picture depending on your settings, and the messages you post."
msgstr ""
"Dans un groupe, les autres participants voient votre numéro, votre nom ou "
"pseudonyme, votre photo selon vos réglages et les messages que vous publiez."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:142
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Do not share identity documents, health data, passwords or other sensitive "
"information in the group."
msgstr ""
"Il ne faut transmettre aucun document d’identité, donnée de santé, mot de "
"passe ou autre information sensible dans le groupe."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:143
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Match Europe records evidence of agreement and the matching outcome in EURES "
"beta but does not copy the WhatsApp conversation."
msgstr ""
"Match Europe conserve dans EURES beta la preuve de l’accord et l’issue du "
"matching, mais ne recopie pas la conversation WhatsApp."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:144
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"WhatsApp is a Meta service governed by its own terms and data processing. "
"Messages may remain on participants’ devices until deleted."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp est un service de Meta soumis à ses propres conditions et "
"traitements de données. Les messages peuvent rester sur les appareils des "
"participants jusqu’à leur suppression."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:151
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Retention and security"
msgstr "Durée et sécurité"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:153
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Operational data is retained for 12 months after the last contact, then "
"deleted or anonymised when no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"Les données opérationnelles sont conservées pendant 12 mois après le dernier "
"contact, puis supprimées ou anonymisées lorsqu’elles ne sont plus "
"nécessaires."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:154
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Access is limited to authorised staff and professional accounts use "
"strengthened authentication."
msgstr ""
"Les accès sont limités aux personnes habilitées et les comptes "
"professionnels sont protégés par une authentification renforcée."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:155
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "A data incident or misuse will suspend the relevant test."
msgstr ""
"Un incident de données ou un usage détourné entraîne la suspension du test "
"concerné."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:162
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Your rights and contact"
msgstr "Vos droits et contact"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:164
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"You may request access, rectification or deletion, withdraw your agreement "
"or object to certain uses where the law allows."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez demander l’accès, la rectification ou l’effacement de vos "
"données, retirer votre accord ou vous opposer à certains usages lorsque la "
"réglementation le permet."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:165
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Eric Barthélémy is the sole contact point during this phase. To exercise "
"your rights or ask a question: matcheurope.00040@francetravail.fr."
msgstr ""
"Eric Barthélémy est le point de contact unique pendant cette phase. Pour "
"exercer vos droits ou poser une question : "
"matcheurope.00040@francetravail.fr."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:166
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"You may also lodge a complaint with the competent data protection authority."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez également introduire une réclamation auprès de l’autorité de "
"protection des données compétente, notamment la CNIL en France."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:172
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Back to home"
msgstr "Retour à l’accueil"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:177
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid ""
"Match Europe · A France Travail / EURES / ADEM / Le Forem / ELA experiment"
msgstr ""
"Match Europe · Une expérimentation France Travail / EURES / ADEM / Le "
"Forem / ELA"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/privacy.html:178
msgctxt "employer privacy"
msgid "Useful links"
msgstr "Liens utiles"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:8
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Notification test"
msgstr "Test des notifications"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:63
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:68
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Test notifications on your Mac"
msgstr "Test des notifications sur votre Mac"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:70
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid ""
"Use Chrome in a normal window. This test does not change any offer or enrol "
"your company in the pilot."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez Chrome dans une fenêtre normale. Ce test ne modifie aucune offre et "
"n’inscrit pas votre entreprise au pilote."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:73
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Enable notifications and choose Allow in Chrome."
msgstr "Activez les notifications et choisissez Autoriser dans Chrome."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:74
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid ""
"Schedule a notification, then close this tab. Keep Chrome open for this "
"first test."
msgstr ""
"Programmez une notification puis fermez cet onglet. Gardez Chrome ouvert "
"pour ce premier test."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:75
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Wait ten seconds. Click the notification to return here."
msgstr "Attendez dix secondes. Cliquez sur la notification pour revenir ici."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:77
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Enable notifications"
msgstr "Activer les notifications"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:78
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Send in 10 seconds"
msgstr "Envoyer dans 10 secondes"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:79
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Test display on this Mac"
msgstr "Tester l’affichage sur ce Mac"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:81
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Checking the browser…"
msgstr "Vérification du navigateur…"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:82
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid "Stop the test"
msgstr "Arrêter le test"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:83
msgctxt "push diagnostic"
msgid ""
"This browser's subscription is kept in your local session. The test message "
"goes through the browser's notification service (Google for Chrome). No "
"offer content or email is sent."
msgstr ""
"L’abonnement de ce navigateur est conservé dans votre session locale. Le "
"message de test passe par le service de notification du navigateur (Google "
"pour Chrome). Aucun contenu d’offre ni email n’est envoyé."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/push-test.html:85
