msgstr "Confirmer le lancement simulé"

#: eures_beta/templates/employer_workspace.html:526
msgid ""
"This offer changed or a start is already pending. Review its current version "
"before confirming."
msgstr ""
"Cette offre a changé ou un lancement est déjà en attente. Consultez sa "
"version actuelle avant de confirmer."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer_workspace.html:538
msgid ""
