"it."
msgstr ""
"Un collègue a modifié cette offre. Ouvrez la version actuelle avant de la "
"dupliquer."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:5
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "An experiment in the Greater Region"
msgstr "Une expérimentation dans la Grande Région"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:6
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"Facilitating recruitment and professional mobility in the Greater Region"
msgstr ""
"Faciliter les recrutements et la mobilité professionnelle dans la Grande "
"Région"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:7
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"Match Europe is testing a new way to connect employers’ needs with "
"candidates’ mobility plans in a cross-border economic area."
msgstr ""
"Match Europe expérimente une nouvelle façon de rapprocher les besoins des "
"employeurs et les projets de mobilité des candidats dans un espace "
"économique transfrontalier."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:8
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "Start as a candidate"
msgstr "Commencer côté candidat"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:9
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "Start as an employer"
msgstr "Commencer côté employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:12
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "A cross-border labour market that remains fragmented"
msgstr "Un marché du travail transfrontalier encore fragmenté"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:13
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"The labour market extends beyond national borders, but recruitment and job "
"searches are still largely organised country by country."
msgstr ""
"Le marché du travail dépasse les frontières nationales, mais les "
"recrutements et les recherches d'emploi restent encore largement organisés "
"pays par pays."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:14
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"The project aims to better identify needs, mobility intentions and "
"opportunities to support more relevant and faster introductions."
msgstr ""
"Le projet vise à mieux identifier les besoins, les intentions de mobilité et "
"les opportunités afin de favoriser des mises en relation plus pertinentes et "
"plus rapides."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:15
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"In the Greater Region, several hundred thousand people already work across "
"borders. Yet job offers and applications still circulate with difficulty "
"between countries."
msgstr ""
"Dans la Grande Région, plusieurs centaines de milliers de personnes "
"travaillent déjà au-delà des frontières. Pourtant, les offres d'emploi et "
"les candidatures circulent encore difficilement entre les pays."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:16
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"Employers face recruitment difficulties, while candidates open to mobility "
"do not always find the opportunities that might suit them."
msgstr ""
"Des employeurs rencontrent des difficultés de recrutement tandis que des "
"candidats ouverts à la mobilité ne repèrent pas toujours les opportunités "
"qui pourraient leur correspondre."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:19
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "A few figures about the Greater Region"
msgstr "Quelques repères sur la Grande Région"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:21
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"280,000 cross-border workers travel within the Greater Region every day."
msgstr ""
"280 000 travailleurs frontaliers circulent chaque jour dans la Grande Région."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:22
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "40–50k people with cross-border experience could be looking for a job."
msgstr ""
"40–50 k personnes avec expérience transfrontalière pourraient rechercher un "
"emploi."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:23
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "15,000+ positions may remain vacant in the same economic area."
msgstr "15 000+ postes resteraient vacants dans le même bassin économique."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:27
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "Two complementary journeys"
msgstr "Deux parcours complémentaires"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:30
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "Candidate journey"
msgstr "Parcours candidat"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:31
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"The service helps understand people’s mobility plans, skills, languages and "
"preferences to identify opportunities that could suit them more easily."
msgstr ""
"Le service permet de mieux comprendre les projets de mobilité, les "
"compétences, les langues et les préférences des personnes afin d'identifier "
"plus facilement les opportunités susceptibles de leur correspondre."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:32
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "View the candidate journey"
msgstr "Voir le parcours candidat"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:35
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "Employer journey"
msgstr "Parcours employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:36
msgctxt "public home"
msgid ""
"The service helps clarify recruitment needs and better account for important "
"constraints and criteria to facilitate introductions."
msgstr ""
"Le service aide à qualifier les besoins de recrutement et à mieux prendre en "
"compte les contraintes et critères importants pour faciliter les mises en "
"relation."

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:37
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "View the employer journey"
msgstr "Voir le parcours employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:42
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "An experiment focused on usage"
msgstr "Une expérimentation centrée sur les usages"

#: eures_beta/templates/home.html:45
msgctxt "public home"
msgid "Test quickly"
msgstr "Tester rapidement"

