msgstr "Sources et données à consolider"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:35
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"The Greater Region already functions as a cross-border labour market: around "
"280,000 people cross a border every day for work. People with cross-border "
"experience are looking for jobs, companies face recruitment difficulties, "
"yet tools, vacancies and support remain largely organised at national level."
msgstr ""
"La Grande Région constitue déjà un bassin d’emploi transfrontalier: environ "
"280 000 personnes franchissent quotidiennement une frontière pour "
"travailler. Des personnes disposant d’une expérience transfrontalière "
"recherchent un emploi, des entreprises rencontrent des difficultés de "
"recrutement, mais les outils, les offres et les accompagnements restent "
"encore largement organisés à l’échelle nationale."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:36
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"The labour market already works across borders, but return-to-work pathways "
"and introduction tools still do not fully reflect that reality."
msgstr ""
"Le marché du travail fonctionne déjà à l’échelle transfrontalière, mais les "
"parcours de retour à l’emploi et les outils de mise en relation ne suivent "
"pas encore pleinement cette réalité."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:40
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"Sophie lives in Thionville and worked in Luxembourg for eight years. After a "
"restructuring, she loses her job. Her experience could match needs in "
"France, Luxembourg or Wallonia, but she does not always have the right "
"channels to identify these opportunities and be introduced within a "
"reassuring framework."
msgstr ""
"Sophie habite à Thionville et a travaillé pendant huit ans au Luxembourg. À "
"la suite d’une restructuration, elle perd son emploi. Son expérience peut "
"correspondre à des besoins situés en France, au Luxembourg ou en Wallonie, "
"mais elle ne dispose pas toujours des bons relais pour identifier ces "
"opportunités et être mise en relation dans un cadre rassurant."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:41
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"This example illustrates a typical situation. It does not refer to an "
"identified real case."
msgstr ""
"Cet exemple illustre une situation type. Il ne correspond pas à un cas réel "
"identifié."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:48
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Identifying candidates who are genuinely interested in mobility."
msgstr "L’identification des candidats réellement intéressés par la mobilité."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:49
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Qualifying skills, constraints and expectations."
msgstr "La qualification des compétences, contraintes et attentes."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:50
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Understanding employer needs."
msgstr "La compréhension des besoins employeurs."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:51
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Building trust at the time of first contact."
msgstr "La confiance accordée au premier contact."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:52
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Providing human support during introductions."
msgstr "L’accompagnement humain dans la mise en relation."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:53
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Coordinating public employment services."
msgstr "La coordination entre services publics de l’emploi."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:59
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Mobilising employers."
msgstr "La mobilisation d’employeurs."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:60
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Collecting employer needs."
msgstr "Le recueil des besoins."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:61
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Identifying candidates."
msgstr "L’identification de candidats."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:62
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Qualifying profiles."
msgstr "La qualification des profils."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:63
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Producing relevant matching proposals."
msgstr "Les propositions de matching pertinentes."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:64
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Organising first introductions."
msgstr "Les premières mises en relation."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:66
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"The main obstacle is not matching. It is trust at the moment of first "
"contact."
msgstr ""
"Le principal frein n’est pas le matching. C’est la confiance au moment du "
"premier contact."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:74
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Proximity of public employment services"
msgstr "La proximité des services publics de l’emploi"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:75
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"Local teams present the service, explain how it works and help build trust."
msgstr ""
"Les équipes locales présentent le service, expliquent son fonctionnement et "
"contribuent à instaurer la confiance."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:78
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Explainable cross-border matching"
msgstr "Un matching transfrontalier explicable"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:79
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"Introductions may take into account occupation, key skills, languages, "
"mobility and location, availability, working conditions, qualifications or "
"authorisations, as well as salary expectations. Results must remain "
"understandable and humanly validated."
msgstr ""
"Les rapprochements peuvent prendre en compte le métier, les compétences "
"clés, les langues, la mobilité et la localisation, la disponibilité, les "
"conditions de travail, les qualifications ou autorisations, ainsi que les "
"attentes salariales. Les résultats doivent rester compréhensibles et validés "
"humainement."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:82
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Human support"
msgstr "Un accompagnement humain"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:83
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"Technology facilitates introductions, but decisions and contacts remain "
"human."
msgstr ""
"La technologie facilite le rapprochement, mais la décision et la mise en "
"relation restent humaines."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:92
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Service presentation"
msgstr "Présentation du service"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:93
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Registration and consent"
msgstr "Inscription et consentement"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:94
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Qualification of the candidate or employer need"
msgstr "Qualification du candidat ou du besoin employeur"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:95
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Matching proposal"
msgstr "Proposition de matching"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:96
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Contact through an identified channel"
msgstr "Prise de contact par un canal identifié"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:97
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Introduction and follow-up"
msgstr "Mise en relation et suivi"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:102
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"The proposed pilot brings together France, Wallonia and Luxembourg. The aim "
"is not immediate large-scale deployment, but gradual co-design in order to "
"adapt the journey, clarify roles, progressively identify willing teams or "
"territories, mobilise candidates, collect employer needs, test introductions "
"and measure results."
msgstr ""
"Le pilote envisagé associe la France, la Wallonie et le Luxembourg. "
"L’objectif n’est pas un déploiement immédiat à grande échelle, mais une "
"coconstruction progressive pour adapter le parcours, préciser les rôles, "
"identifier progressivement des équipes ou territoires volontaires, mobiliser "
"des candidats, recueillir des besoins employeurs, tester les mises en "
"relation et mesurer les résultats."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:104
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "France"
msgstr "France"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:105
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Wallonia"
msgstr "Wallonie"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:106
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Luxembourg"
msgstr "Luxembourg"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:113
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"The first step sought is to identify, within each partner organisation, a "
"contact person who could contribute to co-design."
msgstr ""
"La première étape recherchée est l’identification, chez chaque partenaire, "
"d’un interlocuteur susceptible de participer à la coconstruction."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:115
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Clarify territorial needs."
msgstr "Préciser les besoins du territoire."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:116
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Adapt candidate and employer journeys."
msgstr "Adapter le parcours candidat et employeur."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:117
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Define consent arrangements."
msgstr "Définir les modalités de consentement."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:118
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Identify available data and resources."
msgstr "Identifier les données et ressources disponibles."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:119
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Prepare the gradual involvement of local teams."
msgstr "Préparer progressivement l’implication des équipes locales."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:120
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Suggest shared indicators."
msgstr "Proposer des indicateurs communs."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:121
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Analyse results."
msgstr "Analyser les résultats."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:126
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"An experimental horizon of around 300 qualified candidates informed about "
"how the service works would provide enough diversity of profiles, help "
"secure consent, produce more relevant introductions and improve "
"responsiveness to employer needs."
msgstr ""
"Un horizon expérimental d’environ 300 candidats qualifiés et informés du "
"fonctionnement du service permettrait de disposer d’une diversité suffisante "
"de profils, de mieux sécuriser le consentement, de produire des "
"rapprochements plus pertinents et d’améliorer la réactivité face aux besoins "
"employeurs."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:127
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "This horizon is not a quota imposed on each partner."
msgstr "Cet horizon n’est pas un quota imposé à chaque partenaire."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:131
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"The project may also help identify situations in which a plan focused on one "
"labour market becomes durably difficult."
msgstr ""
"Le projet peut aussi aider à repérer les situations dans lesquelles un "
"projet vers un marché donné devient durablement difficile."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:133
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Alert an adviser."
msgstr "Alerter un conseiller."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:134
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Propose a diagnostic review."
msgstr "Proposer un diagnostic."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:135
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Identify training needs."
msgstr "Identifier des besoins de formation."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:136
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Suggest adjacent occupations."
msgstr "Suggérer des métiers proches."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:137
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Propose other geographical opportunities."
msgstr "Proposer d’autres opportunités géographiques."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:138
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Avoid a job search that remains blocked over time."
msgstr "Éviter une recherche durablement sans issue."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:140
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"Any analysis must remain explainable, controlled, used as decision support "
"and validated by a human."
msgstr ""
"Toute analyse doit rester explicable, contrôlée, utilisée comme aide à la "
"décision et validée humainement."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:145
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "A clear institutional identity for the service."
msgstr "Une identité institutionnelle claire du service."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:146
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Well-managed contact channels."
msgstr "Des canaux de contact maîtrisés."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:147
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Explicit consent."
msgstr "Un consentement explicite."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:148
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Appropriate data protection."
msgstr "Une protection des données adaptée."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:149
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Defined authorisations."
msgstr "Des habilitations définies."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:150
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Human validation of decisions and introductions."
msgstr "Une validation humaine des décisions et des mises en relation."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:152
msgctxt "project page"
msgid ""
"WhatsApp Business may be considered as a possible channel, without implying "
"that it is already active."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp Business peut constituer un canal envisagé, sans préjuger de son "
"activation."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:157
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Start from field realities."
msgstr "Partir du terrain."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:158
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Test quickly."
msgstr "Tester rapidement."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:159
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Progress through iterations."
msgstr "Progresser par itérations."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:160
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Measure real impact."
msgstr "Mesurer l’impact réel."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:161
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Remain transparent."
msgstr "Rester transparent."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:162
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Adjust or stop an unconvincing hypothesis."
msgstr "Ajuster ou arrêter une hypothèse non concluante."

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:169
msgctxt "project page"
msgid "Mobilisation"
msgstr "Mobilisation"

#: eures_beta/templates/project.html:171
msgctxt "project page"
