#: eures_beta/candidates/templates/candidates/journey.html:6
msgid ""
"Local demonstration — use fictional information only. No account is created "
"and nothing is sent to an adviser or employer."
msgstr ""
"Démonstration locale — utilisez uniquement des informations fictives. Aucun "
"compte créé, aucun envoi à un conseiller ou employeur."

